- op: discuss  # 27d8
  at: '2026-11-10T23:38:12Z'  # 27d8
  by: agent  # 27d8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 27d8
  clock: 3  # 27d8
  nonce: 27d8  # 27d8
  message: "Owner decision 2026-11-10: go with fix (a), a narrowing_blocker that refuses narrowing when a changed file has a changed <module> or class-body block, unless the owner says otherwise after this note. Reason: every test that imports a module runs its import-time code, so the only safe keep set for such a file is all its importers, which is the un-narrowed import-graph selection; (b) only adds narrowing of the OTHER files in a multi-file change. Measured over the last 400 commits on dev: 113 modified package source; in 90 (80%) at least one changed file had a changed <module> block, 3 more changed only a class body, 20 (18%) changed only function or method bodies. Per file: 262 of 369 (71%). Follow-up being measured: how many <module> changes are module-docstring-only, which could be routed to the WI-zajuv text-reader set instead of all importers."  # 27d8
